{
  "title": "Cervical Disc Arthroplasty",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/spine/12279/cervical-disc-arthroplasty",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Jul 15 2026",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "SUMMARY",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Cervical disc arthroplasty (CDA) is a motion-preserving technique to replace a cervical disc",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "There is mounting evidence that using CDA to avoid a fusion decreases adjacent-level disease and subsequent reoperation rates",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "The primary contraindication to CDA is advanced degenerative disease of the facets with associated neck pain",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "4",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "History",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "1966: Fernström first implanted a stainless steel ball bearing in the cervical spine, but reported unacceptable rates of device-related complications",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "at that time, ACDF was gaining popularity with reports of great clinical success. Therefore, interest in motion-preserving procedures decreased",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "1980s-1990s: A renewed interest in CDA resurfaced when lumbar disc arthroplasty gained in popularity in Europe",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "2002: First report on modern CDA appeared with the premise that it would decrease or prevent adjacent segment disease by maintaining motion",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "2010-present:",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "several randomized controlled trials demonstrated superiority to cervical fusion with regard to:",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "reoperation rates",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "quicker return to work",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "OUTCOMES",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Benefits and risks",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "benefits",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "potential to preserve motion",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "pseudoarthrosis is less of a concern",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "quicker return to routine activities",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "risks",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "hardware failure with potential paralysis",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "persistent neck pain originating from facets",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Evidence",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "single-level disease",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "CDA equivalent to fusion in:",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "neurologic improvement",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "patient-reported outcomes",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "CDA superior to fusion in:",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "reoperation rates",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "two-level disease",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "CDA equivalent to fusion in:",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "neurologic improvement",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "patient-reported outcomes",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "CDA superior to fusion in:",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "reoperation rates",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "when reoperation does occur for CDA, it is often at the index level and is for implant-related complications",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "-1",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Indications",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Indications",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "primary CDA",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "single- and two-level cervical radiculopathy",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "single- and two-level cervical myelopathy",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "revision CDA",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "if performed within 2 weeks, results are equivalent to primary CDA",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Contraindications",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "significant facet degeneration",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
